{{!
    @template local_oksigeniahechauka/sheet_touch_door

    One door of the card «Se puede tocar» (sheet_touch): drawn as on the screen and in the colour it wears there (the
    centre's skin), lit and ajar when it comes out, closed and in outline when it does not; touched, it changes; its
    arrows move it along its corridor. What goes inside its <li>, which sheet_touch writes with the door's state.

    Example context (json):
    {"key": "menu", "label": "El comedor", "on": true, "visitors": false, "colour": "#4f6b2d"}
}}
    <button type="button" class="hkp-door-art" data-door-toggle aria-pressed="{{#on}}true{{/on}}{{^on}}false{{/on}}"><span class="hkp-door-leaf"><span class="hkp-door-icon"></span></span><span class="hkp-door-name">{{label}}</span></button>
    <span class="hkp-door-move"><button type="button" data-door-move="-1" aria-label="{{#str}}sheet_touch_before, local_oksigeniahechauka, {{label}}{{/str}}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.5 5.5L8 12l6.5 6.5"/></svg></button><button type="button" data-door-move="1" aria-label="{{#str}}sheet_touch_after, local_oksigeniahechauka, {{label}}{{/str}}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9.5 5.5L16 12l-6.5 6.5"/></svg></button></span>
